---------------------------------------------
The image built from this Dockerfile installs the following, unmodified, from
the Alpine Linux package repositories:

  ffmpeg     GPL-2.0-or-later AND LGPL-2.1-or-later
             (Alpine builds it with --enable-gpl --enable-version3)
  python3    PSF-2.0
  alpine     base system and its dependencies, under their respective licenses

silence_monitor.py invokes ffmpeg as a separate process and does not link
against it. Corresponding source for the GPL-licensed components is available
from the Alpine Linux package repositories.


